{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2025-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1751328000, "end_date": 1751932799, "month_true_total": 194, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:55:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "199243632", "author": {"steamid": "76561198799966792", "personaname": "NazG", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/mheoturray/", "num_games_owned": 507, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 1774, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 979, "last_played": 1776722787, "avatar": "18a652b4bb8b9252721250c78fc6455cc93f863f"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's basically Risk of Rain (for the Rogue-Lite Elements) meets Doom/Quake (for the weapon feel and arena shooter elements). An FPS rogue-lite Isn't something I thought I needed as much as I did but its a really really good time.\r\n\r\nIt's pretty hard, and there's big difficulty spikes at times especially if you aren't aware of what you are walking into. You can always get smacked by something from your side/behind with little announcement, so you need your head on a 360 swivel.\r\n(though there are 4 difficulties to chose between with transparent difficulty tweaks between them)\r\n\r\nPlay solo, play with friends, whatever, just give this game a real try, also if you have Xbox gamepass and don't care about having it on steam, then go play it over there, its worth your time!\r\nThat being said, I think this game is a steal on sale and still worth the full price imo.", "timestamp_created": 1751932488, "timestamp_updated": 1751932488, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199232995", "author": {"steamid": "76561198098758783", "personaname": "eggnoggs", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198098758783/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 417, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 49, "last_played": 1785249297, "avatar": "14c1d314fc703b859e632525377b9db4811cd06d"}, "language": "english", "review": "BOOM BOOM ROBOTS AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH", "timestamp_created": 1751921958, "timestamp_updated": 1751921958, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199232418", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042282893", "personaname": "zerosol", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zerosol/", "num_games_owned": 1044, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 2003, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2003, "last_played": 1724980692, "avatar": "95910a2cbfb53303a583ed51b23188747084849b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Absolutely the best FPS Roguelike on the market.  MORE PLEASE!", "timestamp_created": 1751921431, "timestamp_updated": 1751921431, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199228429", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970736031", "personaname": "Caith", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970736031/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 106, "playtime_forever": 470, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 470, "last_played": 1723654067, "avatar": "741f083ac7935d39cf928b65c6365014c16f1c1b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great game, and I fully support the studio's decision to move on to bigger and better things! The beauty of a game like this is you can get a run done in a sitting, have a blast with a friend or two, and then put it away. When these games become live service games, they end up bloated, with long playthroughs to get to the end of a run. Make a new game! I'll buy it!", "timestamp_created": 1751917990, "timestamp_updated": 1751917990, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199221056", "author": {"steamid": "76561198835847189", "personaname": "crichards06", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198835847189/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 1055, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 89, "last_played": 1767360012, "avatar": "76c2c57990ae1af551df7337b66debf3946cccbc"}, "language": "english", "review": "I played the demo a while ago and got exited and now that i played the full game it is really fun.", "timestamp_created": 1751911735, "timestamp_updated": 1751911735, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}